{"nusach":"sefard","id":"birkat_hamazon","sections":[{"title":{"he":"לפני ברכת המזון","en":"Before Grace"},"segments":[{"he":[[{"t":"בחול אומרים לפני ברכת המזון:","s":"n"}]],"en":"On weekdays, before Birkat HaMazon:"},{"he":[[{"t":"עַל־נַהֲרוֹת","s":"b"},{"t":" בָּבֶל שָׁם יָשַֽׁבְנוּ גַּם־בָּכִֽינוּ בְּזָכְרֵֽנוּ אֶת־צִיּוֹן: עַל־עֲרָבִים בְּתוֹכָהּ תָּלִֽינוּ כִּנֹּרוֹתֵֽינוּ: כִּי שָׁם שְׁאֵלֽוּנוּ שׁוֹבֵֽינוּ דִּבְרֵי־שִׁיר וְתוֹלָלֵֽינוּ שִׂמְחָה שִֽׁירוּ לָֽנוּ מִשִּׁיר צִיּוֹן: אֵיךְ נָשִׁיר אֶת־שִׁיר־יְהֹוָה עַל אַדְמַת נֵכָר: אִם־אֶשְׁכָּחֵךְ יְרוּשָׁלָֽםִ תִּשְׁכַּח יְמִינִי: תִּדְבַּק לְשׁוֹנִי לְחִכִּי אִם־לֺא אֶזְכְּרֵֽכִי אִם־לֺא אַעֲלֶה אֶת־יְרוּשָׁלַֽםִ עַל רֹאשׁ שִׂמְחָתִי: זְכֹר יְהֹוָה לִבְנֵי אֱדוֹם אֵת יוֹם יְרוּשָׁלָֽםִ הָאֹמְ֒רִים עָֽרוּ עָֽרוּ עַד הַיְ֒סוֹד בָּהּ: בַּת־בָּבֶל הַשְּׁ֒דוּדָה אַשְׁרֵי שֶׁיְּ֒שַׁלֶּם־לָךְ אֶת־גְּמוּלֵךְ שֶׁגָּמַלְתְּ לָֽנוּ: אַשְׁרֵי שֶׁיֹּאחֵז וְנִפֵּץ אֶת־עֹלָלַֽיִךְ אֶל־הַסָּֽלַע:"}]],"en":"By the rivers of Babylon, there we sat and we also wept, when we remembered Zion. Upon the willows in its midst, we hung our harps. For there our captors demanded of us words of song, and our tormentors asked of us [with] mirth; Sing to us from the song[s] of Zion. How shall we sing the song of Adonoy on alien soil? If I ever forget you, Jerusalem, may my right hand forget [its movement]. May my tongue cleave to my palate, if I remember you not; if I set not Jerusalem above my highest joy. Remember, Adonoy, to the sons of Edom the day of Jerusalem, [it was they] who said, Raze it, raze it to its very foundation. Daughter of Babylon, you are the annihilated one; fortunate is he who will repay you for all you have done to us. Fortunate is he who will take and dash your little ones against the rock."}]},{"title":{"he":"זימון","en":"Zimun"},"segments":[{"he":[[{"t":"רַבּוֹתַי נְבָרֵךְ:","s":"b"}]],"en":"\"Gentlemen, let us say the blessing:","minyan":{"he":"המזמן אומר","en":"The leader says"}},{"he":[[{"t":"יְהִי שֵׁם","s":"b"},{"t":" יְהֹוָה מְבֹרָךְ מֵעַתָּה וְעַד־עוֹלָם:"}]],"en":"The Name of Adonoy will be blessed from now forever.","minyan":{"he":"המסובים עונים","en":"The others respond"}},{"he":[[{"t":"יְהִי שֵׁם","s":"b"},{"t":" יְהֹוָה מְבֹרָךְ מֵעַתָּה וְעַד־עוֹלָם:"}]],"en":"\"The Name of Adonoy will be blessed from now forever.\"","minyan":{"he":"המזמן אומר","en":"The leader says"}},{"he":[[{"t":"בִּרְשׁוּת","s":"b"},{"t":" מָרָנָן וְרַבָּנָן וְרַבּוֹתַי נְבָרֵךְ ("},{"t":"בעשרה","s":"n"},{"t":" אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ) שֶׁאָכַֽלְנוּ מִשֶּׁלּוֹ:"}]],"en":"\"With your permission our masters and teachers, Let us bless (our God,) Him, for we have eaten of His bounty.\"","minyan":{"he":"המזמן אומר","en":"The leader says"}},{"he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ","s":"b"},{"t":" ("},{"t":"בעשרה","s":"n"},{"t":" אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ) שֶֽׁאָכַֽלְנוּ מִשֶּׁלּוֹ וּבְטוּבוֹ חָיִֽינוּ:"}]],"en":"Blessed is (our God) He for we have eaten of His bounty and through His goodness we live.","minyan":{"he":"המסובים עונים","en":"The others respond"}},{"he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ","s":"b"},{"t":" ("},{"t":"בעשרה","s":"n"},{"t":" אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ) שֶֽׁאָכַֽלְנוּ מִשֶּׁלּוֹ וּבְטוּבוֹ חָיִֽינוּ:"}]],"en":"\"Blessed is (our God) He for we have eaten of His bounty and through His goodness we live.\"","minyan":{"he":"המזמן אומר","en":"The leader says"}},{"he":[[{"t":"בעשרה מוסיפים:","s":"n"},{"t":" בָּרוּךְ הוּא וּבָרוּךְ שְׁמוֹ:"}]],"en":"Blessed is He and blessed is His Name.","minyan":{"he":"המזמן אומר","en":"The leader says"}}]},{"title":{"he":"זימון בסעודת שבע ברכות","en":"Zimun at a Sheva Berachot Meal"},"optional":{"he":"בסעודת שבע ברכות","en":"At a sheva berachot meal"},"segments":[{"he":[[{"t":"רַבּוֹתַי נְבָרֵךְ:","s":"b"}]],"en":"Gentlemen, let us say the blessing.","minyan":{"he":"המזמן אומר","en":"The leader says"}},{"he":[[{"t":"יְהִי שֵׁם","s":"b"},{"t":" יְהֹוָה מְבֹרָךְ מֵעַתָּה וְעַד־עוֹלָם:"}]],"en":"The Name of Adonoy will be blessed from now forever.","minyan":{"he":"המסובים עונים","en":"The others respond"}},{"he":[[{"t":"יְהִי שֵׁם","s":"b"},{"t":" יְהֹוָה מְבֹרָךְ מֵעַתָּה וְעַד־עוֹלָם:"}]],"en":"The Name of Adonoy will be blessed from now forever.","minyan":{"he":"המזמן אומר","en":"The leader says"}},{"he":[[{"t":"דְּוַי הָסֵר","s":"b"},{"t":" וְגַם חָרוֹן, וְאָז אִלֵּם בְּשִׁיר יָרוֹן, נְחֵֽנוּ בְּמַעְגְּ֒לֵי צֶֽדֶק, שְׁעֵה בִּרְכַּת (בְּנֵי יְשֻׁרוּן) בְּנֵי אַהֲרֹן:"}]],"en":"Banish sorrow and fury too and then the mute will exult in song. Guide us in the paths of righteousness. Heed the blessing of the children of Jeshurun (and) the sons of Aaron.","minyan":{"he":"המזמן אומר","en":"The leader says"}},{"he":[[{"t":"בִּרְשׁוּת","s":"b"},{"t":" מָרָנָן וְרַבָּנָן וְרַבּוֹתַי נְבָרֵךְ אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ שֶׁהַשִּׁמְחָה בִּמְעוֹנוֹ (וְ)שֶׁאָכַֽלְנוּ מִשֶּׁלּוֹ:"}]],"en":"With your permission our masters and teachers, let us bless our God, in Whose abode is joy for we have eaten of His bounty.","minyan":{"he":"המזמן אומר","en":"The leader says"}},{"he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ","s":"b"},{"t":" אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ שֶׁהַשִּׁמְחָה בִּמְעוֹנוֹ (וְ)שֶׁאָכַֽלְנוּ מִשֶּׁלּוֹ וּבְטוּבוֹ חָיִֽינוּ:"}]],"en":"Blessed is our God in Whose abode is joy for we have eaten of His bounty and through His goodness we live.","minyan":{"he":"המסובים עונים","en":"The others respond"}},{"he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ","s":"b"},{"t":" אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ שֶׁהַשִּׁמְחָה בִּמְעוֹנוֹ (וְ)שֶׁאָכַֽלְנוּ מִשֶּׁלּוֹ וּבְטוּבוֹ חָיִֽינוּ:"}]],"en":"Blessed is our God, in Whose abode is joy [and] we have eaten of His bounty and through His goodness we live.","minyan":{"he":"המזמן אומר","en":"The leader says"}}]},{"title":{"he":"ברכת המזון","en":"Grace After Meals"},"segments":[{"he":[[{"t":"ברכה זו משה רבינו ע\"ה תקנה כשירד המן לישראל","s":"n"}]],"en":"FIRST BERACHA"},{"he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ","s":"b"},{"t":" אַתָּה יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם הַזָּן אֶת־הָעוֹלָם כֻּלּוֹ בְּטוּבוֹ בְּחֵן בְּחֶֽסֶד וּבְרַחֲמִים הוּא נוֹתֵן לֶֽחֶם לְכָל־בָּשָׂר כִּי לְעוֹלָם חַסְדּוֹ וּבְטוּבוֹ הַגָּדוֹל תָּמִיד לֺא־חָסַר לָֽנוּ וְאַל־יֶחְסַר לָֽנוּ מָזוֹן לְעוֹלָם וָעֶד בַּעֲבוּר שְׁמוֹ הַגָּדוֹל כִּי הוּא אֵל זָן וּמְפַרְנֵס לַכֹּל וּמֵטִיב לַכֹּל וּמֵכִין מָזוֹן לְכָל־בְּרִיּוֹתָיו אֲשֶׁר בָּרָא. כָּאָמוּר, פּוֹתֵֽחַ אֶת־יָדֶֽךָ וּמַשְׂבִּֽיעַ לְכָל־חַי רָצוֹן: בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה הַזָּן אֶת־הַכֹּל:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy our God, King of the Universe, Who nourishes the entire world with His goodness, with favor, with kindness, and with mercy. He provides food for all flesh, for His kindness endures forever. And through His great goodness, we have never lacked and we will not lack food forever and ever, for the sake of His great Name. For He is Almighty Who nourishes and maintains all, does good to all, and prepares nourishment for all His creatures which He has created. As it is said: You open Your hand and satisfy the desire of every living being. Blessed are You, Adonoy Who nourishes all."},{"he":[[{"t":"ברכה זו יהושע תקנה כשנכנסו ישראל לארץ","s":"n"}]],"en":"SECOND BERACHA"},{"he":[[{"t":"נוֹדֶה","s":"b"},{"t":" לְּךָ יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ עַל שֶׁהִנְחַֽלְתָּ לַאֲבוֹתֵֽינוּ אֶֽרֶץ חֶמְדָּה טוֹבָה וּרְחָבָה וְעַל שֶׁהוֹצֵאתָֽנוּ יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ מֵאֶֽרֶץ מִצְרַֽיִם וּפְדִיתָֽנוּ מִבֵּית עֲבָדִים וְעַל בְּרִיתְ֒ךָ שֶׁחָתַֽמְתָּ בִּבְשָׂרֵֽנוּ וְעַל תּוֹרָתְ֒ךָ שֶׁלִּמַּדְתָּֽנוּ וְעַל חֻקֶּֽיךָ שֶׁהוֹדַעְתָּֽנוּ וְעַל חַיִּים חֵן וָחֶֽסֶד שֶׁחוֹנַנְתָּֽנוּ וְעַל אֲכִילַת מָזוֹן שָׁאַתָּה זָן וּמְ֒פַרְנֵס אוֹתָֽנוּ תָּמִיד בְּכָל־יוֹם וּבְכָל־עֵת וּבְכָל שָׁעָה:"}]],"en":"We thank You, Adonoy, our God, for Your parceling out as a heritage to our fathers, a land which is desirable, good, and spacious; for Your bringing us out, Adonoy, our God, from the land of Egypt, and redeeming us from the house of bondage; for Your covenant which You sealed in our flesh; for Your Torah which You taught us; for Your statutes which You made known to us; for the life, favor, and kindness which You granted us; and for the provision of food with which You nourish and maintain us constantly, every day, at all times and in every hour."},{"he":[[{"t":"בחנוכה ובפורים אומרים: ","s":"n"},{"t":"וְעַל הַנִּסִּים","s":"b"},{"t":" וְעַל הַפֻּרְקָן וְעַל הַגְּ֒בוּרוֹת וְעַל הַתְּ֒שׁוּעוֹת וְעַל הַנִּפְלָאוֹת וְעַל הַנֶּחָמוֹת וְעַל הַמִּלְחָמוֹת שֶׁעָשִֽׂיתָ לַאֲבוֹתֵֽינוּ בַּיָּמִים הָהֵם בִּזְּ֒מַן הַזֶּה:"}]],"en":"[We thank You] for the miracles for the redemption, for the mighty deeds, for the deliverances, for the wonders for the consolations and for the wars that You performed for our fathers in those days at this season.","when":{"any":["chanukah","chanukahYesterday","purim","purimYesterday"]},"optional":{"he":"אם התחילו לאכול לפני השקיעה בחנוכה או בפורים","en":"If the meal began before sunset on Chanukah or Purim","when":{"any":["chanukahYesterday","purimYesterday"]}}},{"he":[[{"t":"בחנוכה: ","s":"n"},{"t":"בִּימֵי מַתִּתְיָֽהוּ","s":"b"},{"t":" בֶּן־יוֹחָנָן כֹּהֵן גָּדוֹל חַשְׁמוֹנָאִי וּבָנָיו כְּשֶׁעָמְ֒דָה מַלְכוּת יָוָן הָרְ֒שָׁעָה עַל־עַמְּ֒ךָ יִשְׂרָאֵל לְהַשְׁכִּיחָם תּוֹרָתֶֽךָ וּלְהַעֲבִירָם מֵחֻקֵּי רְצוֹנֶֽךָ: וְאַתָּה בְּרַחֲמֶֽיךָ הָרַבִּים עָמַֽדְתָּ לָהֶם בְּעֵת צָרָתָם רַֽבְתָּ אֶת־רִיבָם דַּֽנְתָּ אֶת־דִּינָם נָקַֽמְתָּ אֶת־נִקְמָתָם מָסַֽרְתָּ גִבּוֹרִים בְּיַד חַלָּשִׁים וְרַבִּים בְּיַד מְעַטִּים וּטְמֵאִים בְּיַד טְהוֹרִים וּרְשָׁעִים בְּיַד צַדִּיקִים וְזֵדִים בְּיַד עוֹסְ֒קֵי תוֹרָתֶֽךָ וּלְךָ עָשִֽׂיתָ שֵׁם גָּדוֹל וְקָדוֹשׁ בְּעוֹלָמֶֽךָ וּלְעַמְּ֒ךָ יִשְׂרָאֵל עָשִֽׂיתָ תְּשׁוּעָה גְדוֹלָה וּפֻרְקָן כְּהַיּוֹם הַזֶּה וְאַחַר כַּךְ בָּֽאוּ בָנֶֽיךָ לִדְבִיר בֵּיתֶֽךָ וּפִנּוּ אֶת הֵיכָלֶֽךָ וְטִהֲרוּ אֶת מִקְדָּשֶֽׁךָ וְהִדְלִֽיקוּ נֵרוֹת בְּחַצְרוֹת קָדְשֶֽׁךָ וְקָבְ֒עוּ שְׁמוֹנַת יְמֵי חֲנֻכָּה אֵֽלּוּ לְהוֹדוֹת וּלְהַלֵּל לְשִׁמְךָ הַגָּדוֹל:"}]],"en":"In the days of Matisyahu, son of Yochanan the High Priest, the Hasmonean and his sons, when the evil Greek kingdom rose up against Your people Israel to make them forget Your Torah and to turn them away from the statutes of Your will— You, in Your abundant mercy, stood by them in their time of distress, You defended their cause, You judged their grievances, You avenged them. You delivered the mighty into the hands of the weak, many into the hands of the few, defiled people into the hands of the undefiled, the wicked into the hands of the righteous, and insolent [sinners] into the hands of diligent students of Your Torah. And You made Yourself a great and sanctified name in Your world. And for Your people, Israel, You performed a great deliverance and redemption unto this very day. Afterwards, Your sons entered the Holy of Holies of Your Abode, cleaned Your Temple, purified Your Sanctuary, and kindled lights in the Courtyards of Your Sanctuary, and designated these eight days of Chanukah to thank and praise Your great Name.","when":{"any":["chanukah","chanukahYesterday"]},"optional":{"he":"אם התחילו לאכול לפני השקיעה בחנוכה או בפורים","en":"If the meal began before sunset on Chanukah or Purim","when":{"any":["chanukahYesterday","purimYesterday"]}}},{"he":[[{"t":"בפורים: ","s":"n"},{"t":"בִּימֵי מָרְדְּכַי וְאֶסְתֵּר","s":"b"},{"t":" בְּשׁוּשַׁן הַבִּירָה כְּשֶׁעָמַד עֲלֵיהֶם הָמָן הָרָשָׁע בִּקֵּשׁ לְהַשְׁמִיד לַהֲרוֹג וּלְאַבֵּד אֶת־כָּל־הַיְּ֒הוּדִים מִנַּֽעַר וְעַד־זָקֵן טַף וְנָשִׁים בְּיוֹם אֶחָד בִּשְׁלוֹשָׁה עָשָׂר לְחֹֽדֶשׁ שְׁנֵים־עָשָׂר הוּא חֹֽדֶשׁ אֲדָר וּשְׁלָלָם לָבוֹז: וְאַתָּה בְּרַחֲמֶֽיךָ הָרַבִּים הֵפַֽרְתָּ אֶת־עֲצָתוֹ וְקִלְקַֽלְתָּ אֶת מַחֲשַׁבְתּוֹ וַהֲשֵׁבֽוֹתָ לּוֹ גְּמוּלוֹ בְּרֹאשׁוֹ וְתָלוּ אוֹתוֹ וְאֶת־בָּנָיו עַל־הָעֵץ:"}]],"en":"In the days of Mordechai and Esther in Shushan the Capital [of Persia], when the evil Haman rose up against them, he sought to destroy, to kill, and to annihilate all the Jews, young and old, infants and women, in one day, the thirteenth day of the twelfth month, which is the month of Adar, and to plunder their wealth And You, in Your abundant mercy, annulled his counsel, frustrated his intention, and brought his evil plan upon his own head, and they hanged him and his sons upon the gallows.","when":{"any":["purim","purimYesterday"]},"optional":{"he":"אם התחילו לאכול לפני השקיעה בחנוכה או בפורים","en":"If the meal began before sunset on Chanukah or Purim","when":{"any":["chanukahYesterday","purimYesterday"]}}},{"he":[[{"t":"וְעַל הַכֹּל","s":"b"},{"t":" יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ אֲנַֽחְנוּ מוֹדִים לָךְ וּמְבָרְ֒כִים אוֹתָךְ יִתְבָּרַךְ שִׁמְךָ בְּפִי כָּל־חַי תָּמִיד לְעוֹלָם וָעֶד כַּכָּתוּב וְאָכַלְתָּ וְשָׂבָֽעְתָּ וּבֵרַכְתָּ אֶת־יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֶֽיךָ עַל־הָאָֽרֶץ הַטּוֹבָה אֲשֶׁר נָתַן־לָךְ בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה עַל־הָאָֽרֶץ וְעַל־הַמָּזוֹן:"}]],"en":"For everything Adonoy, our God, We thank You and bless You. Blessed be Your Name through the mouth of all the living, constantly, forever, as it is written: When You have eaten and are satisfied, You will bless Adonoy, your God, for the good land which He has given to you. Blessed are You, Adonoy, for the land and for the food."},{"he":[[{"t":"בונה ירושלים דוד ושלמה תקנוה. דוד תקן על ישראל עמך ועל ירושלים עירך. ושלמה תיקן ועל הבית הגדול וכו'.","s":"n"}]],"en":"THIRD BERACHA"},{"he":[[{"t":"רַחֵם","s":"b"},{"t":" יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ עַל־יִשְׂרָאֵל עַמֶּֽךָ וְעַל יְרוּשָׁלַֽיִם עִירֶֽךָ וְעַל צִיּוֹן מִשְׁכַּן כְּבוֹדֶֽךָ וְעַל מַלְכוּת בֵּית דָּוִד מְשִׁיחֶֽךָ וְעַל־הַבַּֽיִת הַגָּדוֹל וְהַקָּדוֹשׁ שֶׁנִּקְרָא שִׁמְךָ עָלָיו אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ אָבִֽינוּ רְעֵֽנוּ זוּנֵֽנוּ פַּרְנְ֒סֵֽנוּ וְכַלְכְּ֒לֵֽנוּ וְהַרְוִיחֵֽנוּ וְהַרְוַח־לָֽנוּ יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ מְהֵרָה מִכָּל־צָרוֹתֵֽינוּ וְנָא אַל־תַּצְרִיכֵֽנוּ יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ לֺא לִידֵי מַתְּ֒נַת בָּשָׂר וָדָם וְלֺא לִידֵי הַלְוָאָתָם כִּי אִם לְיָדְ֒ךָ הַמְּ֒לֵאָה הַפְּ֒תוּחָה הַקְּ֒דוֹשָׁה וְהָרְ֒חָבָה שֶׁלֺּא נֵבוֹשׁ וְלֺא נִכָּלֵם לְעוֹלָם וָעֶד:"}]],"en":"Have compassion, Adonoy, our God, on Israel, Your people, on Jerusalem, Your city, on Zion, the dwelling place of Your glory, on the kingship of the house of David, Your anointed; and on the great and holy House upon which Your Name is called. Our God, our Father tend us, nourish us, maintain us, sustain us, relieve us and grant us relief Adonoy, our God, speedily from all our troubles. Adonoy, our God—may we never be in need of the gifts of men nor of their loans, but only of Your hand which is full, open, holy and generous, so that we may not be shamed nor humiliated forever and ever."},{"he":[[{"t":"בראש חודש ובחול המועד אומרים: ","s":"n"},{"t":"אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ","s":"b"},{"t":" וֵאלֹהֵי אֲבוֹתֵֽינוּ יַעֲלֶה וְיָבֹא וְיַגִּֽיעַ וְיֵרָאֶה וְיֵרָצֶה וְיִשָּׁמַע וְיִפָּקֵד וְיִזָּכֵר זִכְרוֹנֵֽנוּ וּפִקְדוֹנֵֽנוּ וְזִכְרוֹן אֲבוֹתֵֽינוּ וְזִכְרוֹן מָשִֽׁיחַ בֶּן־דָּוִד עַבְדֶּֽךָ וְזִכְרוֹן יְרוּשָׁלַֽיִם עִיר קָדְשֶֽׁךָ וְזִכְרוֹן כָּל־עַמְּ֒ךָ בֵּית יִשְׂרָאֵל לְפָנֶֽיךָ, לִפְלֵיטָה לְטוֹבָה לְחֵן וּלְחֶֽסֶד וּלְרַחֲמִים וּלְחַיִּים טוֹבִים וּלְשָׁלוֹם בְּיוֹם"}]],"en":"Our God and God of our fathers, may there ascend, come, and reach, appear, be desired, and heard, counted and recalled our remembrance and reckoning; the remembrance of our fathers; the remembrance of the Messiah the son of David, Your servant; the remembrance of Jerusalem, city of Your Sanctuary; and the remembrance of Your entire people, the House of Israel, before You for survival, for well-being, for favor, kindliness, compassion, for good life and peace on this day of:","when":{"any":["cholHamoedPesach","cholHamoedPesachYesterday","cholHamoedSukkot","cholHamoedSukkotYesterday","roshChodesh","roshChodeshYesterday"]},"optional":{"he":"אם התחילו לאכול לפני השקיעה בראש חודש או בחול המועד","en":"If the meal began before sunset on Rosh Chodesh or Chol Hamoed","when":{"any":["roshChodeshYesterday","cholHamoedPesachYesterday","cholHamoedSukkotYesterday"]}}},{"he":[[{"t":"לְר\"ח:","s":"n"},{"t":" רֹאשׁ הַחֹֽדֶשׁ הַזֶּה"}]],"en":"Rosh Chodesh","when":{"any":["roshChodesh","roshChodeshYesterday"]},"optional":{"he":"אם התחילו לאכול לפני השקיעה בראש חודש או בחול המועד","en":"If the meal began before sunset on Rosh Chodesh or Chol Hamoed","when":{"any":["roshChodeshYesterday","cholHamoedPesachYesterday","cholHamoedSukkotYesterday"]}}},{"he":[[{"t":"לְפֶסַח: חַג הַמַּצּוֹת הַזֶּה"}]],"en":"the Festival of Matzos","when":{"any":["cholHamoedPesach","cholHamoedPesachYesterday"]},"optional":{"he":"אם התחילו לאכול לפני השקיעה בראש חודש או בחול המועד","en":"If the meal began before sunset on Rosh Chodesh or Chol Hamoed","when":{"any":["roshChodeshYesterday","cholHamoedPesachYesterday","cholHamoedSukkotYesterday"]}}},{"he":[[{"t":"לְסֻכּוֹת: חַג הַסֻּכּוֹת הַזֶּה"}]],"en":"the Festival of Sukkos","when":{"any":["cholHamoedSukkot","cholHamoedSukkotYesterday"]},"optional":{"he":"אם התחילו לאכול לפני השקיעה בראש חודש או בחול המועד","en":"If the meal began before sunset on Rosh Chodesh or Chol Hamoed","when":{"any":["roshChodeshYesterday","cholHamoedPesachYesterday","cholHamoedSukkotYesterday"]}}},{"he":[[{"t":"זָכְרֵֽנוּ יְהֹוָה אֱלֹהֵֽינוּ בּוֹ לְטוֹבָה, וּפָקְדֵֽנוּ בוֹ לִבְרָכָה, וְהוֹשִׁיעֵֽנוּ בוֹ לְחַיִּים טוֹבִים, וּבִדְבַר יְשׁוּעָה וְרַחֲמִים חוּס וְחָנֵּֽנוּ, וְרַחֵם עָלֵֽינוּ וְהוֹשִׁיעֵֽנוּ, כִּי אֵלֶֽיךָ עֵינֵֽינוּ, כִּי אֵל מֶֽלֶךְ חַנּוּן וְרַחוּם אָֽתָּה:"}]],"en":"Remember us Adonoy, our God, on this day for well-being; be mindful of us on this day for blessing, and deliver us for good life. In accord with the promise of deliverance and compassion, spare us and favor us, have compassion on us and deliver us; for to You our eyes are directed because You are the Almighty Who is King, Gracious, and Merciful.","when":{"any":["cholHamoedPesach","cholHamoedPesachYesterday","cholHamoedSukkot","cholHamoedSukkotYesterday","roshChodesh","roshChodeshYesterday"]},"optional":{"he":"אם התחילו לאכול לפני השקיעה בראש חודש או בחול המועד","en":"If the meal began before sunset on Rosh Chodesh or Chol Hamoed","when":{"any":["roshChodeshYesterday","cholHamoedPesachYesterday","cholHamoedSukkotYesterday"]}}},{"he":[[{"t":"וּבְנֵה","s":"b"},{"t":" יְרוּשָׁלַֽיִם עִיר הַקֹּֽדֶשׁ בִּמְהֵרָה בְיָמֵֽינוּ: בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה בּוֹנֵה בְרַחֲמָיו יְרוּשָׁלָֽיִם, אָמֵן:"}]],"en":"Rebuild Jerusalem, city of the Holy Sanctuary, speedily, in our days. Blessed are You, Adonoy, Builder of Jerusalem in His mercy. Amein."},{"he":[[{"t":"הטוב והמטיב ביבנה תקנוה ביום שנתנו הרוגי ביתר לקבורה. הטוב שלא הסריחו. והמטיב שנתנו לקבורה.","s":"n"}]],"en":"FOURTH BERACHA"},{"he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ","s":"b"},{"t":" אַתָּה יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם, הָאֵל אָבִֽינוּ, מַלְכֵּֽנוּ, אַדִּירֵֽנוּ בּוֹרְ֒אֵֽנוּ, גּוֹאֲלֵֽנוּ, יוֹצְ֒רֵֽנוּ, קְדוֹשֵֽׁנוּ קְדוֹשׁ יַעֲקֹב, רוֹעֵנוּ רוֹעֵה יִשְׂרָאֵל, הַמֶּֽלֶךְ הַטּוֹב, וְהַמֵּטִיב לַכֹּל, שֶׁבְּ֒כָל יוֹם וָיוֹם הוּא הֵטִיב, הוּא מֵטִיב, הוּא יֵיטִיב לָנוּ, הוּא גְמָלָֽנוּ, הוּא גוֹמְ֒לֵֽנוּ, הוּא יִגְמְ֒לֵֽנוּ לָעַד לְחֵן וּלְחֶֽסֶד וּלְרַחֲמִים וּלְרֶוַח הַצָּלָה וְהַצְלָחָה בְּרָכָה וִישׁוּעָה, נֶחָמָה, פַּרְנָסָה וְכַלְכָּלָה, וְרַחֲמִים, וְחַיִּים וְשָׁלוֹם, וְכָל־טוֹב, וּמִכָּל־טוּב לְעוֹלָם אַל יְחַסְּ֒רֵֽנוּ:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy our God, King of the Universe, the Almighty, our Father, our King, our Mighty One, our Creator, our Redeemer, our Maker, our Holy One, Holy One of Jacob, our Shepherd, Shepherd of Israel, the King, Who is good and beneficent to all. Every single day He has done good, does good, and will do good to us. He has rewarded us, He rewards us, He will reward us forever with favor, kindness, and compassion, relief, rescue, and success, blessing, deliverance, and consolation, maintenance, sustenance, compassion, life, peace, and everything good; and of all good things may He never deprive us."}]},{"title":{"he":"הרחמן","en":"Harachaman"},"segments":[{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":" הוּא יִמְלוֹךְ עָלֵֽינוּ לְעוֹלָם וָעֶד:"}]],"en":"The Merciful One will reign over us forever and ever."},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":" הוּא יִתְבָּרֵךְ בַּשָּׁמַֽיִם וּבָאָֽרֶץ:"}]],"en":"The Merciful One will be blessed in heaven and on earth."},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":" הוּא יִשְׁתַּבַּח לְדוֹר דּוֹרִים, וְיִתְפָּאֵר בָּֽנוּ לָעַד וּלְנֵֽצַח נְצָחִים, וְיִתְהַדַּר בָּֽנוּ לָעַד וּלְעוֹלְ֒מֵי עוֹלָמִים:"}]],"en":"The Merciful One will be praised for all generations, He will be glorified through us forever and for all eternity; and He will be honored through us for time everlasting."},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":" הוּא יְפַרְנְ֒סֵֽנוּ בְּכָבוֹד:"}]],"en":"May the Merciful One maintain us with honor."},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":" הוּא יִשְׁבּוֹר עֻלֵּֽנוּ מֵעַל צַוָּארֵֽנוּ וְהוּא יוֹלִיכֵֽנוּ קוֹמְ֒מִיּוּת לְאַרְצֵֽנוּ:"}]],"en":"The Merciful One will break the yoke (of oppression) from our necks and lead us upright to our land."},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":" הוּא יִשְׁלַח לָֽנוּ בְּרָכָה מְרֻבָּה בַּבַּֽיִת הַזֶּה וְעַל־שֻׁלְחָן זֶה שֶׁאָכַֽלְנוּ עָלָיו:"}]],"en":"May the Merciful One send us abundant blessing to this house, and upon this table at which we have eaten."},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":" הוּא יִשְׁלַח לָֽנוּ אֶת־אֵלִיָּֽהוּ הַנָּבִיא זָכוּר לַטּוֹב, וִיבַשֶּׂר־לָֽנוּ בְּשׂוֹרוֹת טוֹבוֹת יְשׁוּעוֹת וְנֶחָמוֹת:"}]],"en":"The Merciful One will send us Elijah the prophet, who is remembered for good, who will announce to us good tidings, deliverances, and consolations."},{"he":[[{"t":"אם סמוך על שלחן אביו יאמר:","s":"n"}]],"en":"When eating at your parents' table, say:"},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":" הוּא יְבָרֵךְ אֶת־(אָבִי מוֹרִי) בַּֽעַל הַבַּֽיִת הַזֶּה, וְאֶת־(אִמִּי מוֹרָתִי) בַּעֲלַת הַבַּֽיִת הַזֶּה, אוֹתָם וְאֶת־בֵּיתָם וְאֶת־זַרְעָם וְאֶת־כָּל־אֲשֶׁר לָהֶם"}]],"en":"May the Merciful One bless my father, my teacher, the master of this house, and my mother, my teacher, the mistress of this house; them, their household, their children and all that is theirs."},{"he":[[{"t":"ואם סמוך על שלחן עצמו יאמר:","s":"n"}]],"en":"When eating at your own table, say:"},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":" הוּא יְבָרֵךְ אוֹתִי (וְאֶת־אִשְׁתִּי/בַּעֲלִי וְאֶת־זַרְעִי) וְאֶת־כָּל־אֲשֶׁר לִי."}]],"en":"May the Merciful One bless me, my spouse, my children, and all that is mine;"},{"he":[[{"t":"אוֹתָֽנוּ וְאֶת־כָּל־אֲשֶׁר לָֽנוּ, כְּמוֹ שֶׁנִּתְבָּרְ֒כוּ אֲבוֹתֵֽינוּ, אַבְרָהָם יִצְחָק וְיַעֲקֹב: בַּכֹּל, מִכֹּל, כֹּל, כֵּן יְבָרֵךְ אוֹתָֽנוּ כֻּלָּֽנוּ יַֽחַד, בִּבְרָכָה שְׁלֵמָה, וְנֹאמַר אָמֵן:"}]],"en":"Ours and all that is ours— just as our forefathers were blessed— Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob— In all things, \"From everything,\" and \"With everything\"; so may He bless us, all of us together, with a perfect blessing and let us say Amein."},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":" הוּא יְבָרֵךְ אֶת בַּֽעַל הַבַּֽיִת הַזֶּה, וְאֶת אִשְׁתּוֹ בַּעֲלַת הַבַּֽיִת הַזֶּה, אוֹתָם וְאֶת בֵּיתָם וְאֶת זַרְעָם וְאֶת כָּל אֲשֶׁר לָהֶם. יְהִי רָצוֹן שֶׁלֺּא יֵבוֹשׁ בַּֽעַל הַבַּֽיִת בָּעוֹלָם הַזֶּה וְלֺא יִכָּלֵם לָעוֹלָם הַבָּא וְיִצְלַח מְאֹד בְּכָל־נְכָסָיו וְיִהְיוּ נְכָסָיו וּנְכָסֵֽינוּ מֻצְלָחִים וּקְרוֹבִים לָעִיר וְאַל־יִשְׁלֺט שָׂטָן לֺא בְמַעֲשֵׂי יָדָיו וְלֺא בְמַעֲשֵׂי יָדֵֽינוּ וְאַל יִזְדַּקֵּר לֺא לְפָנָיו וְלֺא לְפָנֵֽינוּ שׁוּם דְּבַר הִרְהוּר חֵטְא וַעֲבֵרָה וְעָוֹן מֵעַתָּה וְעַד עוֹלָם:"}]],"en":"May the Merciful One bless the host and the hostess, them, their household, their children and all that is theirs. May it be God's will that the host not be shamed in this world or humiliated in the World to Come. May he have great success with all his possessions. May his properties and ours prosper and be located close to town. May no evil force have power over his endeavors or our endeavors. May no opportunity present itself before him or before us to contemplate [committing any] sin, transgression or iniquity from now forever.","optional":{"he":"אורח אומר","en":"A guest says"}},{"he":[[{"t":"בַּמָּרוֹם","s":"b"},{"t":" יְלַמְּ֒דוּ עֲלֵיהֶם וְעָלֵֽינוּ זְכוּת שֶׁתְּ֒הֵא לְמִשְׁמֶֽרֶת שָׁלוֹם, וְנִשָּׂא בְרָכָה מֵאֵת יְהֹוָה וּצְדָקָה מֵאֱלֺהֵי יִשְׁעֵֽנוּ, וְנִמְצָא חֵן וְשֵֽׂכֶל טוֹב בְּעֵינֵי אֱלֺהִים וְאָדָם:"}]],"en":"From on high, may there be invoked upon them and upon us, [the] merit to insure peace, And may we receive a blessing from Adonoy, and kindness from the God of our deliverance; and may we find favor and understanding in the eyes of God and man."},{"he":[[{"t":"בראש חודש:","s":"n"}]],"en":"On Rosh Chodesh say:","when":{"any":["roshChodesh","roshChodeshYesterday"]},"optional":{"he":"אם התחילו לאכול לפני השקיעה בראש חודש או בחול המועד","en":"If the meal began before sunset on Rosh Chodesh or Chol Hamoed","when":{"any":["roshChodeshYesterday","cholHamoedPesachYesterday","cholHamoedSukkotYesterday"]}}},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":" הוּא יְחַדֵּשׁ עָלֵֽינוּ אֶת הַחֹֽדֶשׁ הַזֶּה לְטוֹבָה וְלִבְרָכָה:"}]],"en":"May the Merciful One renew for us this month for good and for blessing.","when":{"any":["roshChodesh","roshChodeshYesterday"]},"optional":{"he":"אם התחילו לאכול לפני השקיעה בראש חודש או בחול המועד","en":"If the meal began before sunset on Rosh Chodesh or Chol Hamoed","when":{"any":["roshChodeshYesterday","cholHamoedPesachYesterday","cholHamoedSukkotYesterday"]}}},{"he":[[{"t":"בסוכות:","s":"n"}]],"en":"On Sukkos say:","when":{"any":["cholHamoedSukkot","cholHamoedSukkotYesterday"]},"optional":{"he":"אם התחילו לאכול לפני השקיעה בראש חודש או בחול המועד","en":"If the meal began before sunset on Rosh Chodesh or Chol Hamoed","when":{"any":["roshChodeshYesterday","cholHamoedPesachYesterday","cholHamoedSukkotYesterday"]}}},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":" הוּא יָקִים לָֽנוּ אֶת־סֻכַּת דָּוִד הַנּוֹפָֽלֶת:"}]],"en":"May the Merciful One raise up for us the fallen Tabernacle of David.","when":{"any":["cholHamoedSukkot","cholHamoedSukkotYesterday"]},"optional":{"he":"אם התחילו לאכול לפני השקיעה בראש חודש או בחול המועד","en":"If the meal began before sunset on Rosh Chodesh or Chol Hamoed","when":{"any":["roshChodeshYesterday","cholHamoedPesachYesterday","cholHamoedSukkotYesterday"]}}},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":" הוּא יְזַכֵּֽנוּ לִימוֹת הַמָּשִֽׁיחַ וּלְחַיֵּי הָעוֹלָם הַבָּא, מַגְדִּיל יְשׁוּעוֹת מַלְכּוֹ, וְעֹֽשֶׂה חֶֽסֶד לִמְשִׁיחוֹ לְדָוִד וּלְזַרְעוֹ עַד עוֹלָם: עֹשֶׂה שָׁלוֹם בִּמְרוֹמָיו, הוּא יַעֲשֶׂה שָׁלוֹם עָלֵֽינוּ וְעַל כָּל־יִשְׂרָאֵל, וְאִמְרוּ אָמֵן:"}]],"en":"May the Merciful One make us worthy of the days of the Messiah and life of the World to Come. He who gives great deliverance to His king, (On Shabbos and Yom Tov say: He who is a tower of deliverance to His king,) and shows kindness to His anointed— to David and his descendants forever. He Who makes peace in His high heavens may He make peace for us and for all Israel, and say, Amein."},{"he":[[{"t":"יְראוּ","s":"b"},{"t":" אֶת־יְהֹוָה קְדוֹשָׁיו, כִּי אֵין מַחְסוֹר לִירֵאָיו: כְּפִירִים רָשׁוּ וְרָעֵֽבוּ, וְדוֹרְ֒שֵׁי יְהֹוָה לֺא־יַחְסְ֒רוּ כָל־טוֹב: הוֹדוּ לַיהוָֹה כִּי־טוֹב, כִּי לְעוֹלָם חַסְדּוֹ: פּוֹתֵֽחַ אֶת־יָדֶֽךָ, וּמַשְׂבִּֽיעַ לְכָל־חַי רָצוֹן: בָּרוּךְ הַגֶּֽבֶר אֲשֶׁר יִבְטַח בַּיהוָֹה, וְהָיָה יְהֹוָה מִבְטַחוֹ: נַֽעַר הָיִֽיתִי גַם־זָקַֽנְתִּי וְלֺא־רָאִֽיתִי צַדִּיק נֶעֱזָב, וְזַרְעוֹ מְבַקֶּשׁ־לָֽחֶם: יְהֹוָה עוֹז לְעַמּוֹ יִתֵּן, יְהֹוָה יְבָרֵךְ אֶת־עַמּוֹ בַּשָּׁלוֹם:"}]],"en":"Fear Adonoy, [you] His holy ones, for those who fear Him suffer no deprivation. Young lions may feel want and hunger, but those who seek Adonoy, will not be deprived of any good thing. Give thanks to Adonoy, for He is good, for His kindness endures forever. You open Your hand and satisfy the desire of every living being. Blessed is the man who trusts in Adonoy, so that Adonoy is his security. I was young and I have grown old, yet I have never seen a righteous man forsaken, nor his children begging for bread. Adonoy will give strength to His people, Adonoy will bless His people with peace."}]},{"title":{"he":"הרחמן לברית מילה","en":"Harachaman for a Brit Milah"},"optional":{"he":"בסעודת ברית מילה","en":"At a brit milah meal"},"segments":[{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":", הוּא יְבָרֵךְ אֲבִי הַיֶלֶד וְאִמּוֹ, וְיִזְכּוּ לְגַדְּלוֹ וּלְחַנְּכוֹ וּלְחַכְּמוֹ, מִיּוֹם הַשְּׁמִינִי וָהָלְאָה יֵרָצֶה דָמוֹ, וִיהִי יְהֹוָה אֱלֹהָיו עִמּוֹ. "},{"t":" (אמן:)","s":"n"}]]},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":", הוּא יְבָרֵךְ בַּעַל בְּרִית הַמִּילָה, אֲשֶׁר שָׂשׂ לַעֲשׂוֹת צֶדֶק בְּגִילָה, וִישַׁלֵּם פָּעֳלוֹ וּמַשְׂכֻּרְתּוֹ כְּפוּלָה, וְיִתְּנֵהוּ לְמַעְלָה לְמַעְלָה. "},{"t":" (אמן:)","s":"n"}]]},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":", הוּא יְבָרֵךְ רַךְ הַנִמוֹל לִשְׁמוֹנָה, וְיִהְיוּ יָדָיו וְלִבּוֹ לָאֵל אֱמוּנָה, וְיִזְכֶּה לִרְאוֹת פְּנֵי הַשְּׁכִינָה, שָׁלשׁ פְּעָמִים בַּשָּׁנָה. "},{"t":" (אמן:)","s":"n"}]]},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":", הוּא יְבָרֵךְ הַמָּל בְּשַׂר הָעָרְלָה, וּפָרַע וּמָצַץ דְּמֵי הַמִּילָה, אִישׁ הַיָּרֵא וְרַךְ הַלֵּבָב עֲבוֹדָתוֹ כְּשֵׁרָה, אִם שְׁלָשׁ אֵלֶּה יַעֲשֶׂה לָה. "},{"t":"(נ\"א פְּסוּלָה אִם שְׁלָשׁ לֹא אֵלֶּה יַעֲשֶׂה לָה) (אמן:)","s":"n"}]]},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":", הוּא יִשְׁלַח לָנוּ מְשִׁיחוֹ הוֹלֵךְ תָּמִים, בִּזְכוּת חֲתַן לַמּוּלוֹת דָּמִים, לְבַשֵּׂר בְּשׂוֹרוֹת טוֹבוֹת וְנִחוּמִים, לְעַם אֶחָד מְפֻזָּר וּמְפֹרָד בֵּין הָעַמִּים. "},{"t":" (אמן:)","s":"n"}]]},{"he":[[{"t":"הָרַחֲמָן","s":"b"},{"t":", הוּא יִשְׁלַח לָנוּ כֹּהֵן צֶדֶק אֲשֶׁר לֻקַּח לְעֵילוֹם, עַד הוּכַן כִּסְאוֹ כַּשֶּׁמֶשׁ וְיָהֲלוֹם, וַיָּלֶט פָּנָיו בְּאַדַּרְתּוֹ וַיִּגְלוֹם, בְּרִיתִי הָיְתָה אִתּוֹ הַחַיִּים וְהַשָּׁלוֹם. "},{"t":" (אמן:)","s":"n"}]]}]},{"title":{"he":"אם שכח יעלה ויבוא","en":"If Yaaleh Veyavo Was Forgotten"},"optional":{"he":"אם שכח יעלה ויבוא ונזכר לפני ברכת \"הטוב והמטיב\"","en":"If one forgot Yaaleh Veyavo and remembered before the fourth blessing"},"segments":[{"he":[[{"t":"בָּרוּךְ אַתָּה יְהֹוָה אֱלֺהֵֽינוּ מֶֽלֶךְ הָעוֹלָם אֲשֶׁר נָתַן רָאשֵׁי חֳדָשִׁים לְעַמּוֹ יִשְׂרָאֵל לְזִכָּרוֹן:"}]],"en":"Blessed are You, Adonoy King of the Universe, Who gave Rosh Chodesh days to His people Israel for remembrance.","when":{"all":["roshChodesh"]}}]}],"credits":[{"title":"Siddur Sefard — The Metsudah Siddur, Avrohom Davis (1981)","license":"CC-BY","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Siddur_Sefard"},{"title":"Siddur Sefard — Torat Emet 357","license":"Public Domain","url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Siddur_Sefard"}]}